       description: "The caller's own allowance in one day, never anyone else's (T15), by their role in it (T17; addendum 2): the star (`is_star`) has six drops, any of them photos and at most two of them external video links (`limit` 6, `photo_limit` 6, `external_limit` 2); anyone else has three, at most two photos and at most one video link (3, 2 and 1). The limits are always exactly one of those two sets. The server reads the role from the caller's membership interval and the day's star interval, never from a request. `added`, `photo_added` and `external_added` count committed drops, the only ones that are Added (T20); `reserved`, `photo_reserved` and `external_reserved` count the caller's live reservations, which the limits also count (T18). The photos are the drops less the video links. Drafts and photos in conversations count for nothing (T17, T64)."
